 ("Which ESP32 is best for beginners?", "The original ESP32 or the ESP32-S3, because most tutorials and libraries support them. Choose the ESP32-C6 if you want Thread or Zigbee for smart home projects."),
 ("Are cheap Arduino boards from China fake?", "Not always. Clones under their own brand are legitimate. Boards carrying the Arduino logo at a very low price are counterfeits and can be seized."),
 ("Why is my Arduino clone not detected by my laptop?", "It probably uses a CH340 USB-to-serial chip that needs a driver, or the cable is charge-only. Install the driver and use a data cable."),
